  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Crop Production Research for International Development (SCPRID)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to develop new science and technology to support the development of new crop varieties with more resistance and less vulnerability to biotic and abiotic shocks which will result from new and emerging crop pests and diseases, climate change and water stress.</narrative>
  </description>
